===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[skirmish]]; an [[encounter]].
# {{Scotland|obsolete}} A fight with stones between two parties of boys.
#: {{rfquotek|Jamieson}}
# A [[wrangle]]; also, a noise, as in angry [[contention]].

